# 鉴权与请求头示例，只访问 httpbin.org。不要把真实密钥写进这个文件。

### Bearer 令牌鉴权
GET {{host}}/bearer
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Demo-Env: {{envName}}

### 自定义请求头回显
GET {{host}}/headers
Accept: application/json
X-Client-Name: {{name}}
X-Demo-Env: {{envName}}
X-Source: {{meta.source}}

### 基本鉴权测试
GET {{host}}/basic-auth/tongyun/public-placeholder
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic dG9uZ3l1bjpwdWJsaWMtcGxhY2Vob2xkZXI=
